Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.50,0:00:02.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,Today is Tulsi Vivah —
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.22,0:00:05.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,the wedding that opens the wedding season.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.55,0:00:10.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,Tulsi Vivah is the tulsi plant's wedding to Lord Vishnu.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.72,0:00:13.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,Here Vishnu is in his Shaligram form,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.47,0:00:16.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,so it's also called Tulsi-Shaligram Vivah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.65,0:00:19.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,Yesterday was Dev Uthi Agiyaras.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.74,0:00:23.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,It's believed the Lord wakes after the four months of Chaturmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.92,0:00:25.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,And today, on Kartak Sud Baras,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.95,0:00:29.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,the wedding season begins again with Tulsi Vivah.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.20,0:00:32.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,In homes without a daughter,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.25,0:00:34.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,many families do Tulsi's kanyadaan.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.82,0:00:37.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,Does your family? Tell us in the comments.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.95,0:00:42.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,The wedding is usually this evening, after sunset.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.87,0:00:46.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,For the exact time, check your city's panchang.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.60,0:00:50.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,Stories of Gujarat, on the otlo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.62,0:00:51.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,Follow Otlo.
